  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, and shiitake mushrooms, and cook until the mushrooms are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the snow peas and red cabbage, and cook until the vegetables are tender-crisp, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce, rice vinegar, honey (if using), salt, and black pepper.",
    "Pour the sauce over the vegetables and stir to combine.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a hot stone bowl and garnish with cilantro and scallions.",
    "Serve immediately, and enjoy!"
